
(Hawl cusub: ['List by: 0.']) bilow.
>> x := Hawl cusub: ['Out write: \['hello there\'], stop.'].
x bilow.
Soo-saar qor: ['+ 3 to Number gives: ? '] ? (Tiro + 3), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['Adding 3 to Number gives: ? '] ? (Tiro ku-dar: 3), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['Appending something to String gives: [this]'] [this]: (Qoraal dhammaadka-ku-dar: ['something'])), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: Buuliyaan qoraal, sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: Hawl qoraal, sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ['Can I execute a code block without assigning code?'], sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (Hawl × 10), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (Hawl run: { ['Empty']. }), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (Walax dhammaaday), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (['This <path> has no file'] <path>: Fayl waddada-faylka), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: Liis tirada-guud, sadar-cusub.